	text: [
		"One thing you should do if you are brave enough is looting structures. Nuclear Tech Mod adds a variety of structures filled with cool loot and lore, some of which lets you speed out of the early game.",
		"",
		"The important ones are:",
		"",
		"- Antennas",
		"",
		"- Radio stations",
		"",
		"- Relay stations: Huge antenna-like structures",
		"",
		"- Crashed space ships",
		"",
		"- Crashed vertibirds: Helicopters that are buried, usually contains parts for power armor.",
		"",
		"- Factories: Large brick structures that contain machines and chests full of raw materials, good base location. ",
		"",
		"",
		"However, it's not all candy and rainbows, some places will poison you with radiation--or worse:",
		"",
		"- Nuclear power plants: Full of nuclear waste and extremely radioactive, going near kills in an instant.",
		"",
		"- Nuclear waste storage tanks: Small towers with nuclear waste leaking out of them.",
		"",
		"- Duds: Rusted nukes that can be recycled with a defuser.",
		"",
		"- Poison geyser",
		"",
		"- Missile Silos: Quite rare with one of the most dangerous missile in the game defended by old turrets don't run out of ammo."
